  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 375\u00b0. Grease 9\" square pan.",
    "Toast nuts 4\u20135 minutes.",
    "Combine dry ingredients: oats, nuts, cinnamon, baking powder, salt, nutmeg.",
    "Combine wet ingredients: milk, syrup/honey, vanilla, 2 eggs, and half the butter/oil. Whisk.",
    "Reserve half the blueberries for topping.",
    "Arrange remaining blueberries on bottom of dish.",
    "Cover with dry mix. Drizzle wet mix over top. Wiggle and pat to settle.",
    "Scatter reserved blueberries on top. Sprinkle with sugar.",
